    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/abb326b42d5acae2e0ced492ee691139.avif?t=1667828695\" /></div><br><strong>Box Kid Adventures</strong> is a dynamic, top-down puzzle game.<br>You play as Box Kid \u2013 a toy made of cardboard \u2013 going through various levels, full of nasty enemies and brain challenging puzzles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/63347d1d64a752a2782ab6c401b34f80.webp?t=1667828695\" /></div><br><i>&quot;In the age of electronics, the toy-robots became kids favourite playthings. However, a young, ambitious designer, created a new toy. A Kid. A Box Kid! A toy made out of cardboard. A toy that should breathe life into the world of imagination. But the company's CEO wasn't impressed by that idea and he threw Box Kid into the garbage chute... But was that the real reason? Unveil the truth, as you help Box Kid discover his destiny!&quot;</i><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/a1babc14c9a492ebb2d49c16cc3b78a3.webp?t=1667828695\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPERIENCE...</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/05bc724bd96dac9afc266400a9f4685d.poster.avif?t=1667828695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/05bc724bd96dac9afc266400a9f4685d.webm?t=1667828695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/05bc724bd96dac9afc266400a9f4685d.mp4?t=1667828695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>...simple but deep gameplay, that really captures the spirit of the 8-bit era.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENJOY...</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/94b274d942ac21d0f76ca2d9284d871b.poster.avif?t=1667828695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/94b274d942ac21d0f76ca2d9284d871b.webm?t=1667828695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/94b274d942ac21d0f76ca2d9284d871b.mp4?t=1667828695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>...beautiful, cartoon graphics in Hi-Definition.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GO TROUGH...</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/e85e508374c9425f2e6c2544d2c7745b.poster.avif?t=1667828695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/e85e508374c9425f2e6c2544d2c7745b.webm?t=1667828695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/e85e508374c9425f2e6c2544d2c7745b.mp4?t=1667828695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>...75 various levels, full of nasty enemies and brain challenging puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CREATE AND SHARE...</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/b6398d4844c0421f4840fe370aa32167.poster.avif?t=1667828695\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1217870/extras/b6398d4844c0421f4840fe370aa32167.webm?t=1667828695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c