    "reviews": "\u201cI have enjoyed playing this game so much that I just want to keep going level to level.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 GameSpace<br><br>\u201cAre you looking for something a bit more casual to pass the time but don't want something too easy? Then look no further than T-Rex Interactive's Box Kid Adventures. Sure, at first glance it might look childish because of its cartoonish art style, but dig a little deeper than that and you'll find a puzzle game that strikes that oh, so important balance between challenge and fun.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 DarkStation<br>",
